# armour/shared/pauldron_vented3_l: the medium VENTED pauldron on the left shoulder (vented.3; FORGE-SHOULDERS, STYLE_P2 28.3).
# a broad flat-topped stack of heavy lames like a stove's grate, a dark vent slit under every lit lip (FURNACE,
# emberforged); the slits are its seams (they glow at T5).
# Rides the lean and the bob and lifts a pixel on wind-ups (`up`). Finish regions: R the top lip, G the middle lip's rivet, N the vent slits, P the lips.
# Shared by the man and the woman (D10). Generated by FORGE-SHOULDERS gen.py from shapes.py (re-run, never hand-edit
# the derived views). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
role pauldron vented.3
layer armNear
anchor shoulderL
keys pauld
z 5
side L

